// Relay ONLY an UNEXPECTED fault to an AI-harness pool. An agent PROPOSES; a human reviews.
// Insert near the top of the script. Node >= 16, CommonJS, no dependencies. In an ES module (.mjs) `require` is absent:
// prepend  import { createRequire } from "node:module"; const require = createRequire(import.meta.url);
// A fault = uncaughtException / unhandledRejection. `process.exit(n)` NEVER relays: it is intentional.
//
// Adopter knobs — set BEFORE this block (globalThis):  SHR_CONTRACT_NOTE · SHR_TIER_LOCK ("propose" for gate scripts)
// Runtime env: MAOS_SELFHEAL=0 (off) · MAOS_SELFHEAL_MODE=relay|seed · MAOS_SELFHEAL_TIER=propose|apply
//   MAOS_AI_HARNESS="claude codex" (explicit chain — the ONLY way to use an unverified harness)
